    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 99405ce30e3bc0c7a03a84fc4599ebf8c17f5723 -->\n**Review (M3, local PR-reviewer, Sonnet docs batch, posted under PROCESS_VERSION 32): needs changes before merge.**\n\n**Blocker: `site/content/guide/fundamentals/*.md`.** The cross-links are absolute `https://neotech.github.io/Camcraft/guide/...` URLs, and `zola check` reports 18 broken links.\n- **Fix:** use `@/` internal links.\n- **Merge order:** the targets `/guide/machines/`, `/guide/workholding/`, `/guide/units-and-coordinates/` and `/guide/operations-multiaxis/` come from #1267, #1269, #1258 and #1272. Merge this PR after those, and after #1252/#1259/#1271, because of the `_index.md` append.\n\nThe factual claims that were checked match the code (coolant modes, with Flood as the default).\n",
